Package: irtc
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Title: Dissertation R Package and Thesis Build
Description: R package supporting a dissertation provisioned via dissertation.ai.
    Hosts the dissertation's methodological R code and the Quarto plus XeLaTeX
    thesis-PDF build chain at ui/www/.
